\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Australia \highlight\uc2  c.bank reaps A$5.2 bln  \highlight22\uc2 intervening \highlight\uc2  '83-04.  \b0\par\par\uc2 369 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 September 2004\par 07:24\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     SYDNEY, Sept 13 (Reuters) - \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Australia\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  made a\par profit of A$5.2 billion ($3.6 billion) buying and selling the\par Australian dollar since the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  was floated in 1983, a\par research paper published on Monday said.\par     The Reserve Bank of Australia (RBA) pocketed money in each\par of three distinct exchange-rate cycles in the past two decades,\par the paper said.\par     "\f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has been profitable ... over the entire\par post-float period," said the paper, written by Chris Becker and\par Michael Sinclair of the Reserve Bank's International\par Department.\par     The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  allows the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to trade a wide range,\par but \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervenes\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  if the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  threatens economic growth or the\par bank's inflation target.\par     Since it was floated, the Australian dollar        has\par ranged between just under 48 U.S. cents in April 2001 and 96.5\par U.S. cents in March 1994.\par     The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  rallied 34 percent last year and reached a\par seven-year high above 80 U.S. cents in February.\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  It has since\par declined by more ten 10 U.S. cents.\par     Each of the three periods of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  began with the\par Australian dollar falling and the Reserve Bank selling \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign\par exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , a position that was reversed in the second phase of\par the cycle as the exchange rate rose.\par  \par     The largest daily sale was equivalent to about A$1.2\par billion.\par     Since the 1990s, the Bank oversaw prolonged periods of no\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  punctuated by short-lived episodes of heavy\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , the paper said.\par     The size of average daily sales of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par support the Australian dollar was A$155 million in the last two\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par cycles, up from A$20 million in the first when the bank\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par favoured smaller but more frequent \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Since 1983, the Reserve Bank had transacted in the market\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par on 40 percent of trading days. The bulk of activity was\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par government business, resulting in the Reserve Bank buying\par   \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  on about three times as many days as it sold,\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the study found.\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The main periods of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  have been in the second\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par half of the 1980s, the first half of the 1990s and a third\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par since 1997.\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par ($1=A$1.43).\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020040913e09d00464\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
