\par\par \b \uc2 Aussie dollar rests after rally to new 7-year high.  \b0\par\par\uc2 430 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 Februar 2004\par 00:09\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     SYDNEY, Feb 18 (Reuters) - The Australian dollar        was\par holding close to its overnight seven-year high of 79.88 U.S.\par cents early on Wednesday, with traders saying it was only\par matter of time until the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  pierces the 80 cent level.\par  \par     At 10 a.m. (2300 GMT), the Aussie was trading at\par $0.7980/85, compared with $0.7933/38 late on Tuesday.\par     A conflux of higher metal prices, a hawkish interest-rate\par outlook and a bullish technical picture were all helping the\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par     "It is hard to sees what stalls the momentum. A break of 80\par cents now appears inevitable," said Geoff Bowmer, divisional\par director of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  at Macquarie Bank.\par     "Markets believe the U.S. dollar correction has further to\par go. Very near-term, though, there are likely to be sellers\par ahead of 80 cents and this may cap the local unit on the day,"\par he said.     Helping the Aussie was a rally in metal prices,\par seeing COMEX copper reach levels unseen since May 1996 and gold\par rise 1.4 percent.\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     On the charts, the 10-day moving average moved up above the\par 20-day moving average in recent days, forming a bullish cross.\par     The Aussie offers investors a one-stop shop, giving\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par AAA-rated exposure to the Asia region and commodities just as\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the U.S. dollar has gone out of favour. And with Australia's\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par interest rates at 5.25 percent, investors are reaping around\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par four to five percent more in yield than offered by the\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par greenback or Japanese yen.\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Unlike the Bank of Japan, the Reserve Bank of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Australia\f28 \b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par does not have a pattern of large \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to stem the rise\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "The high yielders all ran to fresh multi-year highs\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par overnight - the Aussie to $0.7988, the kiwi to $0.7090 and\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par sterling to $1.9083," said Bowmer.\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "All are expected to see even higher interest rates over\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par coming months and, with the exception of the kiwi, there is no\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par sign of official anxiety at this point," he said.\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par On Tuesday, Australia's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  kept the door open for\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par a third rate increase, saying strong demand for credit showed\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par recent policy has been stimulatory and prices of assets such as\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par property could not be ignored.\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The Reserve Bank of Australia's deputy governor, Glenn\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Stevens, said policy makers were worried about inflation in\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par goods shielded from exchange rate influence.\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par In local data, the Westpac-Melbourne Institute Leading\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Index for December is released at 2330 GMT (10:30 a.m.).\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020040217e02h003r5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw174\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2610\pichgoal600
