\par\par \b \uc2  UPDATE 1- \highlight22\uc2 Australia \highlight\uc2  RBA made modest  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  in August. \b0\par\par\uc2 284 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 September 2001\par 08:02\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SYDNEY, Sept 20 (Reuters) - The Reserve Bank of Australia \par \par \uc2  said on Thursday it bought a net A$20 million of Australian \par \par \uc2  dollars on the spot \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market during August. \par \par \uc2  This was the second consecutive month the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and now makes it 10 out of the past 12 months that \par \par \uc2  it has had to step in to prop up the unit, according to data in \par \par \uc2  the RBA's September bulletin. \par \par \uc2  "I thought it was a little conservative," said Adam Myers, \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at Westpac on the August total. \par \par \uc2  At the start of August the RBA was rumoured to have \par \par \uc2  supported the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  as it probed below 51 cents, but \par \par \uc2  subsequently it rallied to a six month high of 53.94 cents by \par \par \uc2  August 22. \par \par \uc2  Since then, however, the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been in sharp retreat \par \par \uc2  amid concerns over the global economic outlook and as investors \par \par \uc2  became risk averse following the attacks on the United States \par \par \uc2  on September 11. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  slid to a five month low of 48.94 cents this \par \par \uc2  week, but there has been widespread talk of the RBA having \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in an attempt to at least smooth the Aussie's fall. \par \par \uc2  The AUD stood just above 49 cents on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  "When we get the next month's report you are going to see a \par \par \uc2  much more significant number. It is going to be a big \par \par \uc2  contrast," said Westpac's Myers. \par \par \uc2  Thursday's published figure is not necessarily the total \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the RBA, as it is only a net spot figure. \par \par \uc2  The RBA can also use options to support the Australian \par \par \uc2  dollar, and can roll forward commitments to future settlement \par \par \uc2  dates. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010920dx9k008c6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
