\par\par \b \uc2  UPDATE 1- \highlight22\uc2 Australia \highlight\uc2 's RBA confirms July  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 470 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 August 2001\par 06:13\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SYDNEY, Aug 13 (Reuters) - The Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Australia\b0 \highlight\uc2  resumed \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the Australian dollar in July to the tune of A$297 million (US$154 million), saving the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  from a fresh dip below 50 U.S. cents. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had abstained from \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  for the two previous months. \par \par \uc2  Confirmation the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the spot market came as no surprise as it was widely rumoured to be buying when the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  fell towards 50 cents on a couple of occasions in July, although the amount revealed in the RBA's quarterly monetary policy statement was smaller than some expected. \par \par \uc2  "If you has listened to general market commentators you would have been given the impression that it was a much more substantial amount," said Westpac senior \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist Robert Rennie. \par \par \uc2  "It tells you the RBA still gets a good bang for its buck and markets will always tend to exaggerate all events including rumoured \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," he said. \par \par \uc2  The key move that sparked the talk of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was a quick fall in the Aussie to 50.10 cents on July 12 as the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  became embroiled in worries of emerging markets contagion due to a financial crisis in Argentina and as neighbouring Singapore slid into technical recession. \par \par \uc2  RBA SAYS \b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2  SMALL \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said its latest buying took \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the year to date to A$1.3 billion, which it considered was still a relatively small amount. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  also said in the statement transactions with the Federal government in 2001 to date had also resulted in sales of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  equivalent to A$2.6 billion. \par \par \uc2  These were largely offset by interest on the bank's holdings of foreign securities and transactions with other institutions. \par \par \uc2  The RBA had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  steadily since September last year as the local dollar fell rapidly, hitting a then record low of 50.70 cents in November 2000, and then after rallying to 57.30 cents in January before hitting a fresh all time low of 47.75 cents in April. \par \par \uc2  Since then the Aussie has been roughly rangebound between 50 and 53 cents, supported by improving domestic economic fundamentals, but capped by a dour global environment. \par \par \uc2  The AUD and was trading at around 51.50 cents on Monday. \par \par \uc2  The bank noted the Aussie had not fallen as much against other \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and remained close to its decade average against a basket of \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  comprising the euro, pound, Swiss franc, Canadian dollar, New Zealand dollar and Swedish krona. \par \par \uc2  The RBA also said the relative stability of the Australian dollar against the yen over the past 12 to 18 months was adding to Japanese investor confidence in A$ investments, although these flows had not yet been reflected in capital flow data. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010813dx8d0080z\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
