\par\par \b \uc2  Aussie finds upside tough as propped euro falters. \b0\par\par\uc2 582 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 November 2000\par 23:25\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  ----------------------------------------------------------- \par \par \uc2  AU$S/Term range *Support *Restance *RSI-14 *MA-10  *MA-20 \par \par \uc2    *0.5200/5340  *0.5240  *0.5300   *31.00  *0.5241 *0.5311 \par \par \uc2  -------------VIEWS FROM THE MARKET - Nov 7---------------- \par \par \uc2      *Offshore range roughly $0.5300/5255 \par \par \uc2      *The Australian dollar had another run at the upside in \par \par \uc2  overnight trading, carried along by a rally in the euro after \par \par \uc2  the ECB \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  again, but neither \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was able to \par \par \uc2  carry through the move. \par \par \uc2      *Local activity likely to be thin with Melbourne markets \par \par \uc2  shut for the Melbourne Cup horse race. \par \par \uc2      *RBA board meets for monthly meeting, but no change in \par \par \uc2  policy is expected to be endorsed. \par \par \uc2      SYDNEY, Nov 7 (Reuters) - The Australian dollar had another \par \par \uc2  run at the upside in overnight trading, carried along by a \par \par \uc2  rally in the euro after the European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank intervened\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2  again, but neither \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was able to carry through the move. \par \par \uc2      For the second successive session the ECB attempted to prop \par \par \uc2  up the single European \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  on its own, and while it was \par \par \uc2  successful in lifting it to around 87.30 cents, by the end of \par \par \uc2  New York trading it was floundering just above 86 cents. \par \par \uc2      The Aussie slipstreamed the rally, but failed to make much \par \par \uc2  impression on the 53 U.S. cent barrier. \par \par \uc2      By 8.25 a.m. (2125 GMT) the dollar was $0.5264/69 compared \par \par \uc2  with $0.5269/74 in late Sydney trade on Monday. \par \par \uc2      There was talk that the Reserve Bank had also \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on \par \par \uc2  the Aussie overnight after its rumoured support for the \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  last week. \par \par \uc2      "There was market speculation the RBA was also in the \par \par \uc2  market last night, however, in line with normal practise the \par \par \uc2  RBA did not confirm this at the time," said Greg McKenna, \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at national \b \highlight22\uc2 Australia\b0 \highlight\uc2  Bank. \par \par \uc2  Widespread talk of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Reserve Bank last week \par \par \uc2  staved off what appeared to be an inevitable move to 50 cents, \par \par \uc2  but the Aussie still has plenty of work to do to put it on the \par \par \uc2  road to a sustained recovery. \par \par \uc2  Westpac \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist Robert Rennie said while \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  has reminded the market that selling the Aussie is \par \par \uc2  not without risks, he expects the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to be limited to the \par \par \uc2  high 53 cent region for this week. \par \par \uc2  "In the short term, we take on a slightly more upbeat view \par \par \uc2  about the AUD, at least as long as technical support at 51.90 \par \par \uc2  cents holds on the downside. We view dips towards 52 cents as a \par \par \uc2  buy opportunity, but...a break beneath 51.90 will negate this \par \par \uc2  view," Rennie said. \par \par \uc2      Local activity is likely to be thin on Tuesday with \par \par \uc2  Melbourne markets shut for the Melbourne Cup horse race \par \par \uc2  meeting, and as the market awaits the Reserve Bank of \par \par \uc2  Australia's decision on rates after its monthly board meeting. \par \par \uc2      A Reuters poll of economists taken on Friday gave only a 30 \par \par \uc2  percent risk of a tightening this board meeting, but a slimming \par \par \uc2  majority expect the bank to retain a tightening and raise rates \par \par \uc2  in December or early next year. \par \par \uc2      In any case, and in the current environment, a rate rise \par \par \uc2  now would likely be counter productive for the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , \par \par \uc2  even though a quarter point move would bring the cash rate in \par \par \uc2  line with U.S. fed funds. \par \par \uc2      "We expect a surprise rate hike would be negative for the \par \par \uc2  AUD as the market would not see it as credible given forward \par \par \uc2  indicators for global growth are still deteriorating," said \par \par \uc2  NAB's McKenna. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010822dwb602q3p\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
