\par\par \b \uc2  Australian Dlr Vulnerable Late Following Slide To 12-Yr Low \b0\par\par\uc2 319 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 Juni 1998\par 08:40\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SYDNEY (Dow Jones)--The Australian dollar continued its slide Wednesday, the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  tumbling over one cent during the local trading day to hit a new 12-year low. \par \par \uc2  The Australian dollar bottomed at US$0.5813, its lowest level reached since July 1986. According to dealers, the market is now targeting a retest of the Australian dollar's all-time low at US$0.5717, also touched in July 1986. \par \par \uc2  U.S. speculative-led selling continued Wednesday, while solid selling versus the yen also featured after the Australian dollar broke through a key technical level at Y82.50, according to dealers. \par \par \uc2  At 0620 GMT (4:20 a.m. EDT), the Australian dollar was changing hands at US$0.5827, down around one-and-a-half U.S. cents from US$0.5983 seen late in Sydney Tuesday. It was also at Y82.30, below Y84.07 Tuesday, while the trade-weighted index fell to 54.9 from 55.7. \par \par \uc2  There were rumors about possible \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Australia\b0 \highlight\uc2  Wednesday, but dealers said they couldn't confirm them. \par \par \uc2  A senior trader said he was surprised the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  hadn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  Wednesday to support the Australian dollar, given the magnitude of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's fall and the disorder of the market. \par \par \uc2  "If today's market doesn't qualify as disorderly I don't know what does," he said. \par \par \uc2  Following \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  late last week, Reserve Bank Governor Ian Macfarlane said that the bank would support the Australian dollar when it regarded market movements as excessively volatile. \par \par \uc2  The trader added that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may be waiting for the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to find a bottom level of support before stepping in to buy the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "We may well see (this) in the next 24 hours," the trader said. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 10-06-98 \par \par \uc2  0640GMT \par \par \uc2  1054 22766 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du6a04yd3\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchange or fx or forex or currenc*) and (interven* or operation*) and (australia near10 interven*) and (rst=trtw or rst=tprw or rst=tdjw) and (central bank or ministry of finance or treasury ministry or monetary authority)\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Datum\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 01/01/1995 bis 21/08/2023\cell \pa